<title>BELGIUM: Belgium sells further 450 mln bfr of OLOs.</title>
<headline>Belgium sells further 450 mln bfr of OLOs.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury gave the following details of linear bond (OLO) sales volume at its non-competitive OLO auction - (in billions of Belgian francs)</p>
<p>    Bond line		01/2000   03/2007   Grand total</p>
<p>    Competitive auction  12.790    10.025	22.815</p>
<p>    Non-comp.   auction  nil	  0.450	 0.450</p>
<p>    Total		    12.790    10.475	23.265</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
